266 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (Interpretation: Three techniques have been used to forecast the revenue of the industry, including MA \(moving average technique for three years\), SES \(single exponential smoothing\) and Holt method \(double exponential smoothing\). The most accurate method out of the above is Holt's. Normally, the prediction made is accurate by an error of only about 2.6% but the error rate during the period 2020-2022 is very high due to the effect of the pandemic which no one can predict. Both SES and Holt's give full weight to the last year's figure and this makes the predictions react to current events.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
