/Title (Interpretation: To select which factors we will be trying to predict \(profit margin, whether an airline made a profit and total industry revenue\) and factors that will be used as predictors. Operating income was not used as a factor because it is a product of revenue and profit margin, and its use would mean providing the model with the answer. Revenue per passenger was also not included in the model because its value does not vary much between airlines of the same kind \(legacy, low cost or regional\). Operating income was not used as a predictor because it is a product of revenue and profit margin. Its use would mean providing the model with the answer.)
